 305 000520  1344          TAD ETMP        /IDENTITIES USED ARE:
 306 000521  1342          TAD CSUM        /A+B=(A.XOR.B)+2*(A.AND.B)
 307 000522  3342          DCA CSUM        /A.EQU.B=.NOT.(A.XOR.B)=A.XOR.(.NOT.B)
 308 000523  1344          TAD ETMP        /A.EQU.B=(A+(.NOT.B))-2*(A.AND.(.NOT.B))
